@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam BorderColor #555555
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #fffbe6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #b28704
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #eef3fb
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #4a6fa5
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor transparent
autonumber
participant "RunExecutor" as EX
participant "Database" as DB
participant "RunPlanner (leader)" as PL
participant "Fallback handler" as FB
participant "Business user" as BIZ
participant "REST API (dtp-business)" as API

EX -> DB : package 17 failed, attempts 3 of 3
EX -> DB : package 17 WAITING_FOR_DECISION, INSERT decision request with options
EX -> DB : continue with other packages, run ends COMPLETED_WITH_ISSUES
note over DB : request stays OPEN, it never expires
PL -> DB : open requests with fallback_due_at passed and no fallback run?
PL -> DB : INSERT fallback run, run_key fallback + request id
FB -> FB : execute with typed DecisionRequestContext, e.g. send a reminder
BIZ -> API : GET open decision requests
BIZ -> API : POST decide RESEND_PACKAGE with comment
API -> DB : request DECIDED, decided_by and decided_at audited
API -> DB : package 17 PENDING, attempts reset, back in the requesting step's inbox
note over DB : outside the slot the package waits for the next slot, D39
@enduml
